+## 2. [BLOCKER] Enabling Nacelle+ appears coupled to page-realm execution
+
+**Impact.** A networking companion must not silently collapse the Web Worker isolation boundary. Untrusted project code in the page realm can reach application globals, DOM state, tokens, and agent internals that were not part of the Nacelle capability model.
+
+**Recommended change.** Keep execution in the worker and proxy only transport RPC through the trusted page bridge. If isolation cannot be preserved, fail closed instead of changing realms implicitly.
+
+**Evidence.**
