+## 14. [FEATURE] Cross-layer trace and deterministic failure taxonomy
+
+**Impact.** Agent reliability depends on distinguishing model/provider errors from transport loss, process failure, module resolution, VFS races, permission denial, and quota termination.
+
+**Recommended change.** Use one trace ID across agent -> VFS -> process -> loader -> npm -> network -> extension. Emit structured events with redaction, bounded retention, exportable diagnostic bundles, and stable ERR_NACELLE_* codes.
+
+**Evidence.**
+
+_No single source location; this is an architectural gap inferred from the absence of a cohesive facility._
